        <h1 class="post-detail__title">Teton Valley Community Recycling – Strategic Planning for a Focused, More Effective Organization</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/49539.webp" alt="Teton Valley Community Recycling – Strategic Planning for a Focused, More Effective Organization" loading="lazy">
